{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MixpanelAnalyticsService\/reset()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:23SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics0bC7ServiceV5resetyyYaF","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"reset()","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reset","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Clears the local identity, super properties, and timed events via","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelInstance.reset(completion:)"},{"text":", and returns once that is done.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Init-time super properties are then re-applied.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mixpanelanalyticsservice\/reset()"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MixpanelAnalyticsService"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reset","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything still queued is sent first, and this waits for it: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SDK’s own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reset()"},{"type":"text","text":" sends one 50-record batch and deletes the rest."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Anything the network then fails to take is discarded, as the SDK does."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While opted out this only forgets the adapter’s record of the user."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Opting out has already cleared the SDK’s identity and queue, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SDK’s "},{"code":"reset()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" would also erase the persisted opt-out — the user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would be tracked again from the next launch."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MixpanelAnalyticsService/reset()":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reset"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}],"title":"reset()","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Clears the local identity, super properties, and timed events via","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"MixpanelInstance.reset(completion:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and returns once that is done."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Init-time super properties are then re-applied."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MixpanelAnalyticsService\/reset()","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mixpanelanalyticsservice\/reset()"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MixpanelAnalyticsService":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MixpanelAnalyticsService","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"}],"title":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" conformer that owns and forwards to a Mixpanel SDK"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"instance.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mixpanelanalyticsservice"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Mixpanel adapter for Swidux’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsPlugin"},{"text":". Owns the Mixpanel SDK on the app’s behalf — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService(token:)"},{"type":"text","text":" calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mixpanel.initialize"},{"text":" internally so apps never need to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Mixpanel"},{"text":". Ships a recording mock for previews and tests.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"}}}